# AZ-005: Troubleshooting Azure Blob Storage Access Denied

## Project Overview

This project documents a simulated Azure support incident involving finance employees who were unable to access files stored in Azure Blob Storage.

The objective was to investigate the access failure, identify the underlying causes, apply appropriate corrective actions and validate the resolution using Azure administration and troubleshooting concepts.

