## Key Takeaways

This investigation reinforced an important cloud troubleshooting principle:

**Successful authentication does not guarantee resource authorisation, and successful authorisation does not guarantee network connectivity.**

Azure cloud engineers must investigate identity, permissions, networking and DNS independently before concluding that an incident has been resolved.

